  "prefLabel": "En 1012.15 IA, Inspection, and Operation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1012.15 IA, Inspection, and Operation. Upon the completion of the group study:\n\n(a) The utility shall issue an IA in accordance with En 1011.08;\n\n(b) The applicant shall satisfy witness test procedures consistent with En 1011.09;\n\n(c) The utility shall conduct an inspection consistent with En 1011.10 and 1011.11; and\n\n(d) The facility shall begin operation in accordance with En 1011.12.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
